<h2 data-heading="Этап 14. Подготовка самоподписанного TLS-сертификата" dir="auto">
	Этап 14. Подготовка самоподписанного TLS-сертификата
</h2>
<p dir="auto">
	Для учебной лабораторной работы можно использовать самоподписанный сертификат. Он позволяет проверить работу HTTPS
	без покупки домена и выпуска публичного сертификата.
</p>
<p dir="auto">
	Создать каталог для сертификатов:
</p>
<pre class="language-bash">
	<code class="language-bash is-loaded">
		<span class="token function">sudo</span> <span class="token function">mkdir</span>
		<span class="token parameter variable">-p</span> /etc/nginx/ssl
	</code>
</pre>
<p dir="auto">
	Создать самоподписанный сертификат:
</p>
<pre class="language-bash">
	<code class="language-bash is-loaded">
		<span class="token function">sudo</span> openssl req <span class="token parameter variable">-x509</span>
		<span class="token parameter variable">-nodes</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-days</span>
		<span class="token number">365</span> <span class="token punctuation">\</span>
		<span class="token parameter variable">-newkey</span> rsa:2048 <span class="token punctuation">\</span>
		<span class="token parameter variable">-keyout</span> /etc/nginx/ssl/saas-app.key <span
			class="token punctuation"
		>
			\
		</span>
		<span class="token parameter variable">-out</span> /etc/nginx/ssl/saas-app.crt
	</code>
</pre>
<p dir="auto">
	Во время генерации можно указать следующие значения:
</p>
<table>
	<thead>
		<tr>
			<th>Поле</th>
			<th>Пример</th>
		</tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td>Country Name</td>
			<td><code>RU</code></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>State or Province</td>
			<td><code>Sverdlovskaya oblast</code></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Locality Name</td>
			<td><code>Yekaterinburg</code></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Organization Name</td>
			<td><code>Training SaaS Infrastructure</code></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Organizational Unit</td>
			<td><code>IT Department</code></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Common Name</td>
			<td><code>saas-node-01.local</code></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Email Address</td>
			<td><code>admin@example.local</code></td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
<p dir="auto">
	Проверить наличие файлов:
</p>
<pre class="language-bash">
	<code class="language-bash is-loaded">
		<span class="token function">sudo</span> <span class="token function">ls</span>
		<span class="token parameter variable">-la</span> /etc/nginx/ssl/
	</code>
</pre>
<p dir="auto">
	Ожидаемый результат:
</p>
<pre class="language-bash">
	<code class="language-bash is-loaded">saas-app.crt saas-app.key</code>
</pre>
<p dir="auto">
	Ограничить доступ к приватному ключу:
</p>
<pre class="language-bash">
	<code class="language-bash is-loaded">
		<span class="token function">sudo</span> <span class="token function">chmod</span>
		<span class="token number">600</span> /etc/nginx/ssl/saas-app.key
	</code>
</pre>
<h2 data-heading="Этап 15. Настройка HTTPS в Nginx" dir="auto">Этап 15. Настройка HTTPS в Nginx</h2>
<p dir="auto">
	Открыть конфигурационный файл:
</p>
<pre class="language-bash">
	<code class="language-bash is-loaded">
		<span class="token function">sudo</span> <span class="token function">nano</span> /etc/nginx/sites-available/saas-app
	</code>
</pre>
<p dir="auto">
	Заменить содержимое на конфигурацию с HTTP и HTTPS:
</p>
<pre class="language-nginx">
	<code class="language-nginx is-loaded">
		<span class="token directive"><span class="token keyword">server</span></span>
		<span class="token punctuation">{</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">listen</span> <span class="token number">80</span>
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">server_name</span> saas-node-01.local 192.168.1.50
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>

		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token number">301</span> https://<span
				class="token variable"
			>
				$host
			</span><span class="token variable">$request_uri</span>
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token punctuation">}</span>

		<span class="token directive"><span class="token keyword">server</span></span> <span class="token punctuation">
			{
		</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">listen</span> <span class="token number">443</span> ssl
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">server_name</span> saas-node-01.local 192.168.1.50
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>

		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">ssl_certificate</span> /etc/nginx/ssl/saas-app.crt
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">ssl_certificate_key</span> /etc/nginx/ssl/saas-app.key
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>

		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">access_log</span> /var/log/nginx/saas-app.access.log
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">error_log</span> /var/log/nginx/saas-app.error.log
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>

		<span class="token directive"><span class="token keyword">location</span> /</span> <span
			class="token punctuation"
		>
			{
		</span>
		<span class="token directive"><span class="token keyword">proxy_pass</span> http://127.0.0.1:8080</span><span
			class="token punctuation"
		>
			;
		</span>

		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">proxy_set_header</span> Host <span class="token variable">$host</span>
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">proxy_set_header</span> X-Real-IP <span class="token variable">
				$remote_addr
			</span>
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">proxy_set_header</span> X-Forwarded-For <span class="token variable">
				$proxy_add_x_forwarded_for
			</span>
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">proxy_set_header</span> X-Forwarded-Proto <span class="token variable">
				$scheme
			</span>
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token punctuation">}</span>
		<span class="token punctuation">}</span>
	</code>
</pre>
<p dir="auto">
	В этой конфигурации первый блок принимает HTTP-запросы и перенаправляет их на HTTPS. Второй блок принимает
	HTTPS-запросы, использует сертификат и передаёт запросы на backend.
</p>
<p dir="auto">
	Проверить синтаксис:
</p>
<pre class="language-bash">
	<code class="language-bash is-loaded">
		<span class="token function">sudo</span> nginx <span class="token parameter variable">-t</span>
	</code>
</pre>
<p dir="auto">
	Если ошибок нет, применить конфигурацию:
</p>
<pre class="language-bash">
	<code class="language-bash is-loaded"><span class="token function">sudo</span> systemctl reload nginx</code>
</pre>
